d 'WILDCAT': module to provide a modern Stata graph scheme and Northwestern University brand colors
d
d    wildcat provides a modern, publication-grade Stata graph
d scheme designed to  align closely with the clean, minimalist
d aesthetic of R's ggplot2  (theme_minimal) and companion
d theme_wildcat(). It includes Northwestern  University's official
d brand colors across 23 named color styles (color-*.style)  for
d direct use in graph commands, unshaded transparent facet banners
d without  framing borders, subtle horizontal gridlines with
d vertical gridlines eliminated,  and native palette integration
d with Ben Jann's colorpalette package. 
d
d KW: graph schemes
d KW: colors
d
d Requires: Stata version 14.2
d
d Distribution-Date: 20261107
d
d Author:   Aaron Wolf,   Northwestern University
d Support: email  aaron.wolf@@u.northwestern.edu
d
f wildcat.sthlp
f ../s/scheme-wildcat.sthlp
f ../s/scheme-wildcat.scheme
